  "description": "Frozen single-task Lift pilot matrix (notebook methods 1-8; oracle is an evaluation-time routing diagnostic, not a training cell). One row = a complete run: every training stage in order, then the state-only rollout evaluation (eval.mode=rollout) of the final-stage checkpoint on the frozen reset bank. Seed 42 first; expand to 42, 43, 44 after the pilot gates pass.",
